{"data":[{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107475432757137537","created_at":"2026-10-06T14:17:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107475432757137537"],"id":"2107475432757137537","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":45,"impression_count":431845,"like_count":589,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":92,"retweet_count":3},"text":"其实我还想知道约炮是什么感觉，是俩人一拍即合一到地方就开操吗？那那这样会不会放不开很尴尬什么的啊（）","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2107475432757137537"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107475218084307095","created_at":"2026-10-06T14:17:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107475218084307095"],"id":"2107475218084307095","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":19,"impression_count":37544,"like_count":169,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":8},"text":"认主是什么感觉，就是是那种有认主仪式的认主。会不会感到心灵一颤，很幸福……在被戴上项圈的时候会不会很激动🥹我好想有一个认主仪式啊","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2107475218084307095"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107474764193488921","created_at":"2026-10-06T14:15:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107474764193488921"],"id":"2107474764193488921","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":37193,"like_count":282,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":25,"retweet_count":9},"text":"其实我想知道被主人帮忙洗澡是什么感觉，就是那种像小狗一样被主人洗澡，会不会很尴尬什么的，会不会洗着洗着就做起来了调起来了🥵哇我感觉我就是那种洗着洗着就发情的狗","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2107474764193488921"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107466365640814930","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:41:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107466365640814930"],"id":"2107466365640814930","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5806,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"秩序感强的老实人一直在吃亏……\n我一直都是那个吃亏的老实人……","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2107466365640814930"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107464426752552978","created_at":"2026-10-06T13:34:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_id