t_count":12},"text":"“小骚货怎么主动的送逼上门了？”\n“原来是想念主人的鸡巴想到睡不着”\n“但是鸡巴是奖励，只有够贱够骚的小狗才能吃到”\n“淫水都滴到床上了好孩子”\n“谁也想不到这样一个乖乖女居然背地里那么爱当狗”\n“在很卖力的虐自己呢，但是下手太轻了主人很不满意”\n“求求我，求求我来凌辱你，求求我来蹂躏你”\n“好狗”","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2107421409874190705"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107419709574684992","created_at":"2026-10-06T10:36:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107419716465881482"],"id":"2107419716465881482","in_reply_to_user_id":"2093646888264478721","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1794,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2107419709574684992","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"因为存在这样的传播和社会规范风险，所以值得设置边界","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2107419716465881482"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107419709574684992","created_at":"2026-10-06T10:36:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107419709574684992"],"id":"2107419709574684992","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4998,"like_count":28,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我抵制软色情是因为至少在我看来软色情会因为隐晦而容易传播出去，让儿童接触到，而不知情的儿童看到了则会模仿。再者，当软色情变的广泛，也会让很多人对于此的底线降低，从而让软色情变成“硬色情”。而最重要的是凝视，当我们不再抵制软色情，也会让很多正常的穿搭“色情化”，女生会承受更多的性化凝视","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2107419709574684992"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107417550552510587","created_at":"2026-10-06T10:27:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107417550552510587"],"id":"2107417550552510587","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2610,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"粗暴的调教后是温柔的aftercare","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2107417550552510587"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","conversation_id":"2107417085555225031","created_at":"2026-10-06T10:26:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2107417085555225031"],"id":"2107417085555225031","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"imp